  "description": "The Rose Sneak 2 EQ MidStep gets you through the city easily and sportily, from your commute to your next appointment. Without a motor, you ride directly and sportily, while the minimalist design underlines the urban character. Characteristics and advantages The Rose Sneak 2 EQ MidStep combines a Shimano Cues 6000 shifting system with 1x10 gears, Continental Ride City Reflex tyres and integrated lighting. The high-quality components from renowned manufacturers combine equipment tailored to urban use with reliable function. At just 13.6 kg*, the urban bike is light, agile and fast for sporty riders who cover short distances and quick routes in the city. • 1x10 gear system for uncomplicated shifting • Carbon fork and Continental Ride City Reflex tyres • Optimal equipment for your urban everyday life Ideal for • Sporty commutes on asphalt and paved paths • Quick errands and short distances in the city • Journeys to the office, to appointments or to sport • Movement in everyday life as an alternative to driving by car • City journeys in any weather Less suitable for • Large loads • Long cycle tours and bikepacking • Unpaved forestry tracks and jumps Equipment The Rose Sneak 2 EQ MidStep combines Shimano Cues 6000 with 10 gears and comprehensive EQ equipment. The equipment includes Ergon saddle and grips, Hebie Alumee mudguards, integrated lighting, a rear stand, luggage rack, bell and hydraulic brakes from Shimano. The carbon fork and Rose pedals complement the lightweight concept of the urban bike and make it practically usable for the daily commute on roads and paved paths. • 1 Rose Sneak 2 EQ MidStep • 1 set of pedals (left and right) • 2 pad spacers for disc brakes • 2 reflectors red and white • 1 manual • 1 document bag Note: Weight: approx. 13.6* kg, may vary by up to +/- 5% due to manufacturing tolerances. Weight for frame colour Berry, size M, without pedals",
